  "notes": "Neutral, drone-heavy client in the Caucasus. Taking Azerbaijani work locks out Armenian work for a while (and vice versa). Border tensions with Armenia are low since the 2025 peace process but unresolved (treaty unsigned; Baku demands an Armenian constitutional change). Relations with France and India are hostile because both arm Armenia; with Iran wary.",
